# AI Finance Controller (Prototype-2) — 10-Phase Comprehensive Build Plan

## Executive Architecture & Strategy

This 10-phase build plan transitions the project from the conceptual **Prototype-1** into the research-grade **Prototype-2** architecture as outlined in [architecture_build_plan.txt](file:///c:/Users/srish/Desktop/FinanceOps/architecture_build_plan.txt) and [prototype-2](file:///c:/Users/srish/Desktop/FinanceOps/prototype-2). 

The system is an **evidence-grounded financial reconciliation and verification platform** that combines deterministic accounting controls, candidate retrieval, entity resolution, graph context, anomaly signals, and a **bounded investigation agent** capable of calibrated abstention (`MATCHED`, `EXCEPTION`, `UNCERTAIN`).

### Model Workload Division Principle
- **⚡ Flash Models (Connecting, Bridging, Fast Coding & Plumbing)**:
  - Focused on schema definitions, data parsing/serialization, data storage bindings, API connectors, tool wrapper boilerplate, CLI harnesses, synthetic file generation scripts, standard unit test suites, and frontend/dashboard rendering.
- **🧠 Pro / Thinking Models (Complex Architecture, Financial Algorithms & Reasoning)**:
  - Focused on non-trivial mathematical formulations (cost-weighted loss, ECE/Brier calibration, asymmetric risk boundaries), constraint satisfaction solvers (1-to-N, N-to-1, gross-to-net fee-adjusted matching), agent hypothesis state machines, deterministic invariant verification, adversarial edge-case generation, and statistical ablation design.

